@startuml
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/interaction/sequence-diagram-style.iuml
actor Scanner
participant "Ingest / Validator" as Ingest
participant "Evidence Vault" as Vault
participant "Canonical Findings" as Find
participant "iTop / GLPI" as CMDB
participant "Taiga" as Taiga
participant "Eramba" as GRC
Scanner -> Ingest: signed observation, source run ID
Ingest -> Vault: store raw payload + hash
Ingest -> Find: validated event + idempotency key
Find -> CMDB: scoped asset/service lookup
CMDB --> Find: canonical ID or unresolved
alt authoritative match
 Find -> Taiga: upsert story by finding ID
 Taiga --> Find: story ID + acceptance
 Find -> GRC: risk/control evidence pointer
 GRC --> Find: risk decision reference
else conflict or API failure
 Find -> Find: quarantine / bounded retry / dead letter
end
note over Find,Taiga: Replay must not create duplicate stories.
@enduml
